{
  "comment": [
    "The interfaces gen/domgen.py exports, one C function per IDL member: what a native app's UI uses.",
    "Each interface takes its own members, those of its partial interfaces and those of the mixins it includes,",
    "except partials and mixins declared under the directories of skipDirectories, which hold browser features.",
    "exclude lists members left out by name, as Interface.member, or member alone for every interface.",
    "atomArguments lists operations whose C++ takes AtomString for string arguments the IDL does not mark [AtomString].",
    "Members whose types or extended attributes the generator does not map are left out on their own and listed",
    "in gen/dom-report.txt.",
    "callbackObjectRoots lists callback interfaces passed as refcounted object handles; contract names the shared",
    "contract's function type, and resultEnum the integer enumeration it returns.",
    "typedArrayViewTypes lists the IDL types passed as an in/out typed array: an element kind, a writable buffer and its",
    "byte length; only a [ReturnValue] argument maps. windowObjectBindings binds the operations of the object a readonly",
    "Window attribute (accessor) holds, called through the Window of a checked Document.",
    "eventTargetObjects lists interfaces derived directly from EventTarget whose handles are RvEventTarget references; attached is the C++ condition under which their members answer, else RV_ERR_DETACHED.",
    "setlikeBindings and maplikeBindings bind an interface's setlike or maplike declaration through the adapter class of host/dom/<adapter>.h: size, has, values or get and entries (snapshot copies), and add or set, delete and clear unless readonly.",
    "browserWellFormedUnions and browserWellFormedSetters list the unions and interfaces whose USVString inputs the",
    "Fable browser provider converts to well-formed strings. Every generated string input is UTF-8 with an explicit byte",
    "length; sequenceStringSpans only names the string sequences of its interfaces Utf8.",
    "elementArrayReflections lists [Reflect] FrozenArray<Element>? attributes bound to the engine's element array reflection: the getter returns a snapshot sequence, or none for null; the setter takes a sequence, or none to clear.",
    "syntheticIdl names repository IDL files that define dictionaries only, the native transports of JavaScript object arguments.",
    "argumentTypes retypes Interface.member.argument (by the declaring interface or mixin), and argumentAdapters converts",
    "the decoded argument ({value}) to the C++ the member takes, keyed by the generated function's interface.",
    "globalObjectMembers lists the Interface.member operations whose [CallWith=CurrentGlobalObject] receives the document global object.",
    "customConstructors replaces a [Custom] constructor with the IDL signature its custom binding implements; presenceArguments",
    "gives an optional nullable argument a name_present flag, so absent and null stay distinct. constructors overloads gives",
    "an overload, by argument count, its own factory settings.",
    "optionalObjectMembers lists optional nullable object or node dictionary members passed as Rv<Root>* const* (RvNode* const*): NULL absent, a pointer to NULL null.",
    "absentObjectMembers lists optional nonnullable object dictionary members without a default, passed as Rv<Root>*: NULL absent; in a result dictionary the member is a new reference, or NULL, that the dictionary's release drops.",
    "unionFieldDefaults lists dictionary union members with a string arm whose IDL string default the glue assigns, for a C++ struct that leaves the member empty; a present field replaces it.",
    "setterExpressions maps Interface.member to the C++ a setter calls with {value}, for a member whose C++ type differs from its IDL type.",
    "browserArgumentConversions maps Interface.member.argument to the JavaScript function the Fable provider applies to an argument: Keyframe sequences become the browser's keyframe objects.",
    "settingsDocuments maps an interface to the C++ that reads the Document whose settings gate its [EnabledBySetting] members; null returns RV_ERR_DETACHED.",
    "callbackObjectRoots also lists callback functions (callback X = ...), whose handles the host creates; the generator binds their release and retain.",
    "argumentHostChecks maps an object handle root to the C++ predicate (argument, receiver) that tells whether an argument belongs to the receiver's host: another host returns RV_ERR_WRONG_HOST.",
    "customOperations replaces a [Custom] operation with the signature its native binding implements, and callExpressions names the C++ an operation calls.",
    "syntheticDictionaries lists the dictionaries of syntheticIdl, which no WebKit IDL file defines.",
    "contextDocuments names the C++ document of an object whose operations take a checked context Document: another document returns RV_ERR_WRONG_HOST.",
    "resultValueOverloads adds C++ overloads that convert a result dictionary field to its IDL transport type.",
    "browserResultConversions maps Interface.member to the JavaScript function the Fable provider applies to the browser's result: getKeyframes gives ComputedKeyframe objects.",
    "browserIndexedGetters lists named IDL getters that browsers expose only as an indexed property; the Fable binding reads $0[index], null when absent.",
    "webcoreNames lists the WebCore names that this file's C++ snippets use and no IDL definition declares; the glue writes them WebCore::<name>."
  ],
  "webcoreNames": ["LiveNodeList", "RanvierCollectionLike", "WebAnimationTime"],
